**Finding: compliant (preferred position met).**

The Agreement imposes no non-solicitation, no-hire, or anti-poaching covenant on Mortgage Logic.com. Targeted searches across the full document ("solicit", "employ or engage", "hire", "recruit", "induce … to leave", "Client shall not") surfaced only:

- § 7 (unsolicited commercial e-mail / spamming) — unrelated to personnel;
- § 8(c) Limitation on Access — a Client covenant to restrict Interface access to its own approved officers, employees and agents (benefits confidentiality, not a restrictive covenant);
- § 10 confidentiality provisions — no personnel restriction.

This matches the preferred element "Customer has no non-solicitation restriction," so no redline was proposed. Worth noting for negotiation hygiene: if TrueLink later proposes adding one, our fallback is a mutual, 12-month restriction limited to personnel directly involved in the Services, with general-advertisement and unsolicited-approach carve-outs and no no-hire.
